# Copy this file to ".env" and paste your Apify token below.
# Get a free token: https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations
APIFY_API_TOKEN=apify_api_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# OPTIONAL but recommended: add more free keys so you never run out of credit.
# Every free Apify account comes with monthly credit. Make a few free accounts,
# paste each token here, and the tool automatically rolls to the next key the
# moment one runs dry mid-run. Number them 2, 3, 4, ... in order.
# APIFY_API_TOKEN_2=apify_api_yyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyy
# APIFY_API_TOKEN_3=apify_api_zzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzz

# OPTIONAL: auto-publish leads into a Google Sheet.
# Set this up once (see google-sheet/SETUP.md) and every run appends leads to
# your Sheet. Without it, the tool just saves a CSV.
# Your Lead CRM (dashboard/): every scrape lands in it, no sheet needed.
# CRM_URL=https://your-crm.vercel.app
# CRM_KEY=the key from the CRM's Settings, Developer
# Or the older Google Sheet route:
# SHEETS_WEBHOOK_URL=https://script.google.com/macros/s/xxxxxxxx/exec
# SHEETS_WEBHOOK_TOKEN=optional-password-if-you-set-one-in-the-script

# ===== EMAIL OUTREACH via Resend (the preferred way) =====
# After a scrape, add --email and the tool emails each new lead one of six rotating
# templates, then follows up to five more times on a widening schedule until they
# reply. Every email has ONE link: your video demo. You need a free Resend API key
# and your own domain (about $10 to $12 a year) connected to Resend, so you send
# from your-name@your-domain. Full walkthrough: RESEND-SETUP.md.
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# RESEND_FROM=Your Name <you@yourdomain.com>
# RESEND_REPLY_TO=your-normal-email@gmail.com
# Set these once; they fill the [video link] [name] [phone] spots in every template:
# OUTREACH_VIDEO_LINK=https://www.loom.com/share/your-demo
# OUTREACH_SENDER_NAME=Your Name
# OUTREACH_SENDER_PHONE=+1 555 123 4567
# Sending warms up automatically (starts at about 5 a day, adding ~2 a day up to ~40)
# so a brand-new domain does not look like spam. Once your dashboard has shown green
# at 40 a day for a week or two, raise the ceiling gradually (hard max 100):
# OUTREACH_DAILY_MAX=45
# Prefer to
# send from your Gmail with no domain to buy? The alternative is a free Make.com
# automation, set up by hand in make/SETUP.md. Resend above is preferred.

# OPTIONAL: only if you are on a PAID Make plan (Core or higher) and want the
# one-command installer (make/install_scenario.py) to build the email automation
# for you. Make's API is not on the free plan, so on free just set it up by hand
# (see make/SETUP.md). Zone is the part before .make.com in your Make URL.
# MAKE_API_TOKEN=your-make-api-token
# MAKE_ZONE=eu2
# MAKE_TEAM_ID=only-needed-if-you-have-more-than-one-make-team
